    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the Market – Luxury 2 Bedroom Mid-Terraced Bungalow\r\nNo. 29 Carrowmore Meadows, Knock, Co. Mayo\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this luxury 2-bedroom mid-terraced bungalow, coming to the market in true showhouse condition throughout and located within the highly sought-after Carrowmore Meadows development.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented property offers bright, spacious accommodation together with high-quality finishes throughout and the added benefit of all furniture included in the sale, making it a true turnkey opportunity.\r\n\r\nSituated within walking distance of Knock Shrine and Knock Village, the property also enjoys excellent accessibility to surrounding towns and Ireland West Airport Knock.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nSitting Room:\r\nFitted carpet, curtains, coving and centre piece light, open fireplace with timber surround and granite hearth, double French doors leading to kitchen area.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Area:\r\nFitted kitchen with tiled splashback and tiled flooring, electric hob with extractor fan, separate oven and grill, hardwood rear door to garden, coving and storage cupboard.\r\n\r\nInner Hall:\r\nFitted carpet, fully shelved storage cupboard and attic access.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\nFitted carpet and curtains, coving, bi-fold wardrobe with shelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nFitted carpet and curtains, coving, bi-fold wardrobe with shelving.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom:\r\nWC, WHB with fitted unit over sink, fully tiled floor and walls, walk-in pumped shower and skylight.\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\n• Showhouse condition throughout  \r\n• All furniture included in the sale  \r\n• Luxury 2-bedroom bungalow  \r\n• Beautifully maintained development with landscaped gardens  \r\n• Open fireplace with granite hearth  \r\n• Fully tiled modern bathroom  \r\n• Walking distance to Knock Shrine and village  \r\n• Ideal retirement, holiday or investment property  \r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n• Situated within the highly regarded Carrowmore Meadows development  \r\n• Walking distance to Knock Shrine and local amenities  \r\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock  \r\n• Convenient to Claremorris, Ballyhaunis and Castlebar  \r\n• Excellent road connectivity to surrounding towns and villages  \r\n\r\nThe landscaped gardens and common areas within Carrowmore Meadows are fully maintained, offering a peaceful and attractive residential environment.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers  \r\nMIPAV MMCEPI  \r\nPSRA Licence No: 002031  \r\n\r\nOffices Roscommon & Mayo  \r\n\r\n086 2130723  \r\n094 9362216  \r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details."
      },
